# D23 (LOAD-BEARING, invariant #8): a `throws` call as a MATCH SCRUTINEE with
# non-Result arms, in a non-propagating context. Pre-D23 this SILENTLY SWALLOWED
# the error (no diagnostic; the `throw` was discarded at runtime). Now it must
# REJECT with E_UnhandledThrows.
int risky() throws String:
    throw "boom"

void main():
    match risky():
        case 0:
            print("zero")
        else:
            print("hit-else")
